# ── Check-in policy (2026-06-10): keep SOURCE, not renders ──────────────────
# Commit the diffable source of what we create — *.svg, *.md, *.lua. Do NOT
# commit rendered binary media; it regenerates from the source via
# `rmedia svg2png` / the `rmedia course` pipeline.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.mp3
*.wav
*.pdf
